Package: oneguyos-connect
Version: 0.1.0~beta1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OneGuyOS Beta Team <noreply@oneguyos.invalid>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-dbus, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-zeroconf, python3-ifaddr, kdeconnect
Recommends: xdg-utils, adb, scrcpy, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: OneGuyOS phone connection desktop app (beta)
 A GTK4/Libadwaita desktop app for KDE Connect device controls, phone
 notifications, file sharing, screen preview, and AI chat/recap integrations.
 This beta requires KDE Connect and an Android KDE Connect companion for
 the KDE Connect features. Some screen and companion features are experimental.
